# Data — raw downloads are large and regenerable from the provenance manifest.
# The 300x300 .npy grids ARE committed (~5 MB total): they are required for the
# backend to boot, the test suite silently skips 24 tests without them, and the
# deployment target has an ephemeral filesystem so nothing can be generated there.
backend/data/raw/
backend/data/cache/*.npy.gz

